      "widgets_values": [
        "CRUN NEXT — SAFE START\n\nThis workflow defaults to PREPARE: no API request, upload or charge.\nEnter your API key only through Settings > CRUN Next, never in a workflow.\nConnect Load Image to native IMAGE references, or use Advanced URL fallbacks. Arrays/objects use JSON.\nPREPARE stays local. ESTIMATE uploads connected references and requests a price. GENERATE uploads references and submits a paid task.\nThe optional credit cap is under Advanced: 0 disables it; a positive cap is respected. Review the visible quote receipt.\nDo not share private media links when publishing this workflow.\n\nOption: Seedance 1.0 Pro - Image to Video\nModel: bytedance/seedance1-0-pro-i2v\nDocumentation: https://docs.crun.ai/models/seedance/1-0-pro/image-to-video\n"
